  "notes": "{扱|あつか}う is a godan verb meaning to handle, treat, or deal with something or someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}). Takes を particle.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{扱|あつか}う: to handle/deal with ~\n- 〜{扱|あつか}いする: to treat as ~ (e.g., {子供|こども}{扱|あつか}いする)\n- {取|と}り{扱|あつか}う: to handle, manage (compound verb)\n- {丁寧|ていねい}に{扱|あつか}う: to handle carefully\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {取|と}り{扱|あつか}い: handling, treatment, service\n- {扱|あつか}い{方|かた}: way of handling\n- {取扱|とりあつかい}{説明書|せつめいしょ}: instruction manual",
